  (text "Charger + charge LEDs - TI BQ25173"
    (at 13.97 111.76 0)
    (effects
      (font (size 2 2) bold)
      (justify left bottom)
    )
    (uuid "76693951-cd45-49ce-8f71-7c08aea7d6a4")
  )
  (text "300 mA constant current, then constant voltage.\nVREG = 0.8 V x (1 + R4/R5): LIC 3.71 V (R4 120k) / EDLC 2.62 V (R4 75k).\nCHG (red) lights while STAT is low; FULL (green) when STAT lets go.\nD4/D6 let the RP2040 read charging (CHG) and USB power (USB_DET)."
